        <Property Name="LTXMode" Type="NvidiaSwitchLTXMode.v1_0_0.LTXMode">
          <Annotation Term="OData.Permissions" EnumMember="OData.Permission/ReadWrite"/>
          <Annotation Term="OData.Description" String="The Link Training eXtended (LTX) mode of the switch."/>
          <Annotation Term="OData.LongDescription" String="This property shall contain the LTX mode of the switch.  Link Training eXtended (LTX) improves link quality and stability during link initialization by extending the training flow with additional quality evaluation.  When `Enabled`, the link uses the extended training flow, which can increase link-up time but improves margin on weaker links.  When `Disabled`, the link uses the standard training flow, which brings the link up faster but without the additional LTX optimization.  On the active resource, this property shall be read-only and reflect the currently effective mode.  A client shall PATCH this property on the settings resource to `Enabled` or `Disabled`, or use the `ResetToDefaults` action to restore the default.  The change shall take effect on the next link toggle."/>
